III- Ex-officio members :-
(a)
Secretary to the Government, Department of Agricultural Production, Government of Rajasthan;
(b)
Secretary to the Government, Department of Animal Husbandry, Government of Rajasthan;
(c)
Secretary to the Government, Department of Education, Government of Rajasthan;
(d)
Director of Agriculture, Government of Rajasthan;
(e)
Registrar of the University Member-Secretary
(2)
A nominated member of the Board shall hold office for a term of one year and shall be eligible for appointment for a
second successive term.
